              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "In *The Vampire Diaries*, Elena Gilbert begins her transformation into a vampire in the **Season 3 finale** and completes it in the **Season 4 premiere**:\n\n* **The Setup (Season 3, Episode 22 - \"The Departed\"):** Elena suffers a severe brain hemorrhage and is secretly treated with Damon Salvatore's vampire blood by Dr. Meredith Fell. Later in the episode, Elena is in a car with Matt Donovan when Rebekah Mikaelson causes them to drive off Wickery Bridge and plunge into the water. When Stefan arrives to rescue them, Elena insists that he save Matt first. Elena drowns, but because she had vampire blood in her system, she wakes up on a slab in the morgue in the final seconds of the episode, starting her transition.\n* **The Transition (Season 4, Episode 1 - \"Growing Pains\"):** Elena is in transition and must feed on human blood within 24 hours or die. After being locked up by the town's council, she eventually manages to feed on Matt's blood, completing her transition and officially becoming a vampire.",
